---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-wrap">
		<div class="footer-meta">
			<p class="brand">🌸 SEOUL TRIP NOTE</p>
			<p class="desc">渡韓女子のためのリアル韓国トレンド攻略ガイド。ソウル現地の最新コスメ、美容クリニック、カフェ、お得な旅TIPSをお届けします。</p>
			<div class="biz-info">
				<p>運営元：ジェイワールド (JWorld) ｜ 代表：진시우 (Siwoo Jin)</p>
				<p>事業者登録番号：771-11-02601 ｜ 連絡先：<a href="mailto:help@jworld.dev">help@jworld.dev</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-nav">
			<div class="nav-col">
				<strong>コンテンツ</strong>
				<a href="/">ホーム</a>
				<a href="/blog">記事一覧</a>
				<a href="/about">メディア紹介 (About)</a>
				<a href="/privacy">プライバシーポリシー</a>
			</div>
			<div class="nav-col">
				<strong>JWorld サービス</strong>
				<a href="https://jworld.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">JWorld Studio ↗</a>
				<a href="https://tools.jworld.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">하루 계산기 (Web Tools) ↗</a>
				<a href="https://tools.jworld.dev/bunri/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">韓国ゴミ分別ガイド ↗</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="footer-bottom">
		&copy; {today.getFullYear()} SEOUL TRIP NOTE & JWorld. All rights reserved.
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		padding: 3.5em 1.5em 2.5em 1.5em;
		background: #fafafa;
		color: #555;
		border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea;
		margin-top: 3em;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.footer-wrap {
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}
	.footer-meta {
		flex: 1 1 360px;
	}
	.footer-meta .brand {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ff4b72;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
	}
	.footer-meta .desc {
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		color: #666;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
	}
	.biz-info {
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: #888;
		line-height: 1.6;
		border-top: 1px dashed #e0e0e0;
		padding-top: 0.8rem;
	}
	.biz-info p {
		margin: 0.2rem 0;
	}
	.biz-info a {
		color: #ff4b72;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.footer-nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.nav-col {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}
	.nav-col strong {
		color: #222;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}
	.nav-col a {
		color: #666;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}
	.nav-col a:hover {
		color: #ff4b72;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	.footer-bottom {
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 2.5rem auto 0 auto;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid #eee;
		text-align: center;
		color: #999;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		footer {
			padding: 2.5em 1em 2em 1em;
		}
		.footer-wrap {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.8rem;
		}
	}
</style>
